<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Welcome to openPharmacy</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .box { background: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; }
    .muted { color: #666; font-size: 0.9em; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome, {{fullName}}</h1>
    <p>Your openPharmacy account has been created by an administrator.</p>

    <div class="box">
      <p><strong>Temporary password:</strong></p>
      <code>{{tempPassword}}</code>
    </div>

    <p>For security, please set your own password within 24 hours using the link below:</p>
    <a href="{{changePasswordUrl}}" class="button">Set your password</a>

    <p class="muted">If the button does not work, paste this URL into your browser:<br>{{changePasswordUrl}}</p>
    <p class="muted">If you did not expect this email, please contact your administrator.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
